    "content": "NEW EMPLOYEE FIRST 30 DAYS\n1 Day\nComplete HR documentation, collect laptop and access credentials, review security guidelines, meet the manager and immediate team_\nWeek 1\nComplete mandatory training, understand team processes, review the employee handbook, configure development tools, and attend project orientation.\nWeeks 2-3\nShadow team members, understand assigned responsibilities, review relevant project documentation, and complete a small starter task:\nWeek 4\nDiscuss progress with the manager; identify learning gaps, confirm responsibilities, and agree on goals for the next 60 days.",
